     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Andy,<div>Thanks for the reply.  I&#39;m actually running this analysis as a Bayesian model in JAGS and just using formatdistdata() to help with the setup. So it&#39;s possible we could expand the model to account for grouping in the abundance and observation processes.  I&#39;ll have to refer to ch 9 in AHM to familiarize myself more though.  I appreciate the suggestions!</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thu, Oct 23, 2025 at 10:47 PM &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/unmarked/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(51,51,51)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/unmarked/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447896174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VnaUHe1uPagPiB1B1ZKMH\">\r\n              unma...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:rgb(221,75,57);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447896174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39BziCJF8jdzhkQOgLUWaB\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447896174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39BziCJF8jdzhkQOgLUWaB\"><img style=\"border:0px;vertical-align:middle\" alt=\"Google Groups Logo\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/HIo9b9wMdPKq9cCjipKTCGzwivXRehJm6z8-RBu6XhAN-dSQtOCAZrNe8yif8TkpS7Ar4Gs_OpIWEfoj-YXTuuSRFlukLKUC9FPy3Q=s0-d-e1-ft#https://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_-6982900222684620813_m_6846797130282773922_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n  \r\n    Topic digest\r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/unmarked/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/unmarked/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447896174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VnaUHe1uPagPiB1B1ZKMH\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font:13px/18px arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-6982900222684620813_m_6846797130282773922_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      FormatDistData() question</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119)\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-6982900222684620813_m_6846797130282773922_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0px 5px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/t/451d5390d5d74bea?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/t/451d5390d5d74bea?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447896174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29q8RHvEQtMD61ofKLlkVa\">\r\n      FormatDistData() question\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n  \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211)\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n        Jeffrey Royle &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jar...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Oct 23 06:48PM -0400\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      hi Tom,<br>\r\n I&#39;m afraid formatDistData does not accommodate that situation. But more<br>\r\nimportantly, the models in unmarked DO NOT accommodate non-independent<br>\r\ndetections so you should be careful with that.<br>\r\n Having group detections is complicated because you might have to model<br>\r\ngroup-size dependent detection and _also_ imperfect counting of group size<br>\r\nso more complex models are needed. There are some Bayesian analysis papers<br>\r\nout there on that (including in the AHM1 book, chapter 9).  Also of course<br>\r\nProgram Distance should handle these situations.<br>\r\nregards<br>\r\nandy<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\nOn Wed, Oct 22, 2025 at 1:24 PM &#39;Thomas McLaren&#39; via unmarked &lt;<br>\r\n\r\n    </td></tr>\r\n  \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-6982900222684620813_m_6846797130282773922_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(99,99,99);font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/unmarked/join\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/unmarked/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447896174000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dMbTRTyS0V_MF1wrDXcbN\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr></tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div><div><br clear=\"all\"></div><div><br></div><span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font face=\"Google Sans, Roboto, RobotoDraft, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space